B.beh=new A.bu("Sahih al-Bukhari","Imam Muhammad al-Bukhari (d. 870 CE)","Widely considered the most authentic book after the Qur\u2019an.")
B.bea=new A.bu("Sahih Muslim","Imam Muslim ibn al-Hajjaj (d. 875 CE)","Nearly equal to Sahih al-Bukhari in authenticity.")
B.bdz=new A.bu("Sunan Abu Dawood","Abu Dawood al-Sijistani (d. 889 CE)","Primarily focuses on rulings of Islamic law (fiqh).")
B.be_=new A.bu("Jami\u2019 al-Tirmidhi","Imam al-Tirmidhi (d. 892 CE)","Notable for detailed classifications of hadith and notes on the different legal schools.")
B.bdy=new A.bu("Sunan an-Nasa\u2019i","Al-Nasa\u2019i (d. 915 CE)","Highly respected for the strict criteria the author used in selecting narrators.")
B.ben=new A.bu("Sunan Ibn Majah","Ibn Majah (d. 887 CE)","Added as the sixth book by the scholar Ibn al-Qaisarani in the 11th century \u2014 completing the six canonical collections (al-Kutub as-Sittah).")
