B.y4=s(["That is the same answer I gave a moment ago, and I have no more verified detail to add.","I would only be saying the same thing again, and I have nothing further on my shelf for this.","Repeating it would not help you: that is all I have verified on this."],t.s)
B.bjW=new A.dX([B.wY,B.iN],t.Df)
B.bh9=new A.xi("The Quiet War","Addiction & compulsive habits","You are not your struggle. The fact that you are still fighting after every fall is not weakness. Every return matters. Allah says: \u201cO My servants who have transgressed against themselves [by sinning], do not despair of the mercy of Allah. Indeed, Allah forgives all sins.\u201d (Qur\u2019an 39:53)","\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f","Qur\u2019an 39:53","If you are in danger of overdose or withdrawal, or you are thinking of ending your life, call your local emergency number now. A doctor or an addiction service can walk this road with you; you do not have to do it on willpower alone.",B.bjW)
B.A2=new A.dX([B.hE,B.kh],t.Df)
B.bh7=new A.xi("Between Two Hearts","Marriage & relationships","Hard days do not mean a failed home. The Prophet \ufdfa taught that the best of you is the best to his wives (Jami\u02bf at-Tirmidhi 3895, hasan per Darussalam; sahih per al-Albani). Your marriage is not failing because it struggles; it is alive because you are still here.","\ud83d\udc9e","Jami\u02bf at-Tirmidhi 3895 (hasan per Darussalam; sahih per al-Albani)","If you are ever afraid in your own home, hurt, threatened or forced, that is not a hard patch to endure quietly. Your safety comes first, and you do not have to decide anything tonight. Confidential help is one tap away below.",B.A2)
B.bh8=new A.xi("The House We Grew In","Family wounds","Some wounds come from the hands that raised us. Yusuf \u0639\u0644\u064a\u0647 \u0627\u0644\u0633\u0644\u0627\u0645 was wronged by his own brothers, and when he met them again he said: \u201cNo blame will there be upon you today.\u201d (Qur\u2019an 12:92) Healing here is not pretending it didn\u2019t hurt. It is deciding the hurt stops with you.","\ud83c\udfe0","Qur\u2019an 12:92","If someone in your family hurts or threatens you, or you are afraid to go home, you are allowed to ask for help and to put your safety first. Confidential help is one tap away below.",B.A2)
B.A1=new A.dX([B.iN],t.Df)
B.bh5=new A.xi("The Empty Chair","Grief & loss","The Prophet \ufdfa wept as his son Ibrahim was dying and said: \u201cThe eyes are shedding tears and the heart is grieved, and we will not say except what pleases our Lord.\u201d (Sahih al-Bukhari 1303) Your tears are not weak faith. They are love with nowhere to go.","\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f","Sahih al-Bukhari 1303","Grief can become too heavy to carry alone. If you are thinking of ending your life, please call a crisis line or your local emergency number now.",B.A1)
B.bh6=new A.xi("The Son, The Father, The Husband","A space for men who carry quietly","You were taught to carry, not to speak. The Prophet \ufdfa wept openly as his son Ibrahim was dying (Sahih al-Bukhari 1303), and Allah tells him to say: \u201cI am only a man like you.\u201d (Qur\u2019an 18:110) Strength was never silence. Put it down here; Allah already knows.","\ud83c\udf11","Sahih al-Bukhari 1303 \xb7 Qur\u2019an 18:110","If you are thinking of ending your life, please call a crisis line or your local emergency number now. Needing to say it out loud to a real person is not weakness.",B.A1)
B.bha=new A.xi("The Whisper","Waswas, doubt & scrupulosity","The whisper that torments you is not proof of a sick heart. The Qur\u2019an says what to do when an evil suggestion comes: \u201cAnd if there comes to you from Satan an evil suggestion, then seek refuge in Allah. Indeed, He is the Hearing, the Knowing.\u201d (Qur\u2019an 41:36) You are not what you think. You are what you choose.","\ud83c\udf43","Qur\u2019an 41:36","If the whispers take over your days \u2014 washing, checking, repeating, or fear that will not leave \u2014 it can help to speak to a doctor or counsellor as well as a scholar. Needing both is not a failure of faith.",B.A1)
B.aIE=s([B.bh9,B.bh7,B.bh8,B.bh5,B.bh6,B.bha],A.ac("y<xi>"))
