B.bce=new A.a4("Who writes the answers","H\u0101di answers from a shelf of cited Qur\u2019an and hadith texts built into the app, and works offline. If you connect your own AI account, open questions are answered by that provider\u2019s AI instead. Qur\u2019an is never produced by an AI.")
B.bcp=new A.a4("Not reviewed by a scholar yet","No named scholar has reviewed this app. We check the citations we can and say so when we cannot. Please check anything important with a scholar.")
B.bcx=new A.a4("What it cannot do","It is a study aid, not a mufti. It gives no fatwa, and an AI answer is never a fatwa. It cannot replace a teacher or a scholar.")
B.bcO=new A.a4("What is free","Everything in the app today, including H\u0101di. Nothing asks for a card. A paid plan for extra live answers is planned but not open yet.")
B.bct=new A.a4("What stays on your device","Your settings, bookmarks, progress, reflections and saved H\u0101di conversations. We do not sell your data. See the Privacy Policy (still a draft) for the services the app contacts.")
