B.awl=new A.ko("When you arrive home","Entering with Bismillah and the home dua brings blessing and keeps Shaytan out: \u201cBismillahi walajna, wa bismillahi kharajna, wa \u2019ala Rabbina tawakkalna.\u201d","Sunan Abi Dawud 5096 \u2014 da\u02bfif per al-Albani (weak chain)")
B.awj=new A.ko("Before you sleep tonight","\u201cBismika Allahumma amutu wa ahya\u201d \u2014 in Your name, O Allah, I die and I live. Sleep is the lesser death; hand it to Him.","Sahih al-Bukhari 6324")
B.awk=new A.ko("When you wake","\u201cAlhamdu lillahil-ladhi ahyana ba\u2019da ma amatana wa ilayhin-nushur\u201d \u2014 every morning is a small resurrection, and a second chance.","Sahih al-Bukhari 6312")
B.awn=new A.ko("At your next meal","Bismillah before, eat with the right hand, eat from what is nearest \u2014 three small sunnahs that turn bread into worship.","Sahih Muslim 2022 \u2014 excerpt")
B.awi=new A.ko("The last third of the night","Allah descends and asks: \u201cWho calls upon Me that I may answer? Who asks of Me that I may give?\u201d Even one rak\u2019ah at that hour is heard.","Sahih al-Bukhari 1145 \u2014 excerpt")
B.aww=new A.ko("One salawat, ten returned","\u201cWhoever sends one blessing upon me, Allah sends ten blessings upon him.\u201d The highest-return transaction you will ever make takes three seconds.","Sahih Muslim 408")
B.awv=new A.ko("A call to your parents","Paradise lies at the feet of mothers, and a father is the middle gate of Paradise. If they are alive, one call today is a door held open for you.","Sunan an-Nasa\u2019i 3104, sahih per Darussalam \xb7 Sunan Ibn Majah 3663 \u2014 sahih per Darussalam")
B.awu=new A.ko("The walk to the masjid","Every step to the mosque erases a sin, raises a rank, and writes a good deed. The light on the Day of Judgment is earned one step at a time.","Hadith on the reward of steps to the mosque \u2014 number to be verified")
