B.O4=s(["\u0399","\u03a6","\u039c","\u0391","\u039c","\u0399","\u0399","\u0391","\u03a3","\u039f","\u039d","\u0394"],t.s)
B.aKQ=s(["The forums and meet-ups are for adults aged 18 and over. Children and teenagers never see them.","Your display name is shown to other members. Do not use your full name, a phone number or an e-mail address."],t.s)
B.bh1=new A.uJ("Who this is for",B.aKQ)
B.aXQ=s(["Everything members write is their own opinion. It is not a fatwa and it is not religious guidance, and it is labelled that way.","Please do not give rulings. If you need a ruling, use Ask a scholar: only verified scholars answer there, and their answers are labelled separately from the community.","Hadi, the guide in this app, never reads or learns from community posts."],t.s)
B.bh_=new A.uJ("Community opinion, not a ruling",B.aXQ)
B.aKZ=s(["Be kind. No insults, mockery, backbiting or name-calling.","Disagree gently, and leave a discussion that is making you angry.","No takfir: do not say that another Muslim is outside the faith.","No fighting between schools of thought or groups. Sensitive topics have their own category and every post there is read by a moderator first."],t.s)
B.bgX=new A.uJ("Speak with adab",B.aKZ)
B.aR0=s(["No photos. No home addresses, phone numbers or e-mail addresses, yours or anyone else\u2019s.","There are no private messages. Keep conversations here, in the open.","Do not ask anyone to meet privately, or to move to another app.","Do not share links to other sites unless a moderator has allowed the site. No advertising and no requests for money."],t.s)
B.bh2=new A.uJ("Keep people safe",B.aR0)
B.aLV=s(["Meet-ups are held only in public places: a mosque, a community centre, a library, a halal cafe, a park or a school hall. Never at a home.","The organiser chooses who a meet-up is for: everyone, brothers, sisters, or families. Please respect that choice.","A verified organiser has been checked by a person. An unverified organiser\u2019s meet-up is read by a moderator before it appears.","Children can only come to a families meet-up, with their parent or guardian signing them up. A child\u2019s name is never shown."],t.s)
B.bgZ=new A.uJ("Meet-ups",B.aLV)
B.aDF=s(["You can report, hide or block anything or anyone, at any time, and the person will not be told it was you.","If a child may be at risk, report it as such. It is hidden at once and a person looks at it first."],t.s)
B.bh0=new A.uJ("Report, hide, block",B.aDF)
B.aYu=s(["A moderator may hide a post, warn you, stop you posting for a while, or suspend your account. You are always told why.","You can appeal any decision. A different moderator reads your appeal.","You can export or delete your data at any time."],t.s)
B.bgY=new A.uJ("What happens if rules are broken",B.aYu)
B.aZp=s([B.bh1,B.bh_,B.bgX,B.bh2,B.bgZ,B.bh0,B.bgY],A.ac("y<uJ>"))
B.beI=new A.eK([B.kr,"Find a masjid near you","Mosques around you, on a map","/masajid"])
B.beG=new A.eK([B.xr,"Jumu\u2019ah and prayer times","Set your masjid\u2019s Friday time","/prayer"])
B.aZq=s([B.beI,B.beG],A.ac("y<+(ab,f,f,f)>"))
B.r9=s(["EEEE, d MMMM y","d MMMM y","d MMM y","d/M/yy"],t.s)
B.aZr=s(["/journey"],t.s)
B.bNk=new A.q4("Every Soul Will Taste It","Every soul will taste death, and only on the Day of Judgment will you be paid in full (3:185). The verse is not a threat; it is the calendar. The one who knows the appointment prepares for it \u2014 and preparation is worship.",u.go)
B.bNg=new A.q4("The Will \u2014 Writing It Is a Sunna","The Prophet \ufdfa said: it is not right for a Muslim who has something to bequeath to sleep two nights without having his will written (Bukhari 2738). Two nights. The will is not for the dying; it is for the living who will grieve you.","Draft your will this month \u2014 even a page: debts, guardianship, the small bequests. Templates exist; the intention is the act.")
B.bNh=new A.q4("The Estate \u2014 Fair Before the End","Allah commands you concerning your children: the male receives the share of two females (4:11). The shares are Allah\u2019s math, not the family\u2019s negotiation \u2014 writing them down early is the last act of justice a parent performs.",u.hL)
B.bNf=new A.q4("Plant What Outlives You","When a person dies, their deeds end except three: ongoing charity, knowledge that benefits, and a righteous child who prays for them (Muslim 1631). The grave is not a wall; it is a garden you can still plant.",u.gX)
B.aGw=s([B.bNk,B.bNg,B.bNh,B.bNf],t.Wx)
B.bNn=new A.Ps("Preparing Before the Hour","The Prophet \ufdfa said: remember often the destroyer of pleasures \u2014 death (Tirmidhi 2307, hasan per Darussalam). Not to darken the day, but to brighten the scale.",B.aGw)
B.bNm=new A.q4("La Ilaha Illa Allah \u2014 the Last Word","The Prophet \ufdfa said: whoever\u2019s last words are la ilaha illa Allah enters Paradise (Abu Dawud 3116, sahih per al-Albani). And he advised: prompt your dying to say it, gently, without burden \u2014 the tongue loosens at the end, and the heart follows.",u.dr)
B.bNi=new A.q4("The Prayer Over the Dead","The janazah prayer is offered standing, without bowing or prostration. Four takbirs, salawat on the Prophet, dua for the deceased, and the salah is complete. The community carries the dead to their Lord on its shoulders.",u.oE)
B.bNe=new A.q4("Grieving Is Allowed","The Prophet \ufdfa wept at the death of his son Ibrahim and said: the eyes weep and the heart grieves, and we say only what pleases our Lord \u2014 and we are surely saddened by your departure, Ibrahim (Bukhari 1303). Tears are not weakness; the prohibition was only of wailing and despair.",u.jf)
B.aTa=s([B.bNm,B.bNi,B.bNe],t.Wx)
B.bNo=new A.Ps("The Final Days","How the believer meets the end is a lesson the living need before the dying.",B.aTa)
B.bNl=new A.q4("The Grave Is a Garden","The Prophet \ufdfa said the grave is either a garden from the gardens of Paradise or a pit from the pits of Fire (Tirmidhi 2460, weak per Darussalam \u2014 hold it as a reminder, not a ruling). What you send ahead decides which \u2014 and the sending is still in your hands.",u.dM)
B.bNj=new A.q4("The Meeting You Are Walking Toward","Whoever loves to meet Allah, Allah loves to meet him (Tirmidhi 2309, sahih per Darussalam). The companions lived with this hadith the way travelers live with a map \u2014 not in dread of the road, but in anticipation of the arrival.",u.o6)
B.aH5=s([B.bNl,B.bNj],t.Wx)
B.bNp=new A.Ps("Hope Forward","The school ends where the grave begins: with light.",B.aH5)
B.aZs=s([B.bNn,B.bNo,B.bNp],A.ac("y<Ps>"))
